{"3281130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of Outlaws: Dirt Racing 24 Gold Edition", "steam_appid": 3281130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iRacing presents the Official Game of The World of Outlaws, featuring the World of Outlaws Sprint Car, Late Models and Super DIRTcar Big Block Modifieds,  as well as 8 additional series including the all-new Micro Sprints, and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World of Outlaws: Dirt Racing 24 Gold Edition features 51 tracks, including all your favorites like Eldora Speedway, Knoxville Raceway, and Volusia Speedway Park, with new additions like Kevin Harvick’s Kern Raceway, Millbridge Speedway, Oswego Speedway and Huset's Speedway (coming soon). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a LEGEND like Donny Schatz as you work your way through Career Mode in your quest to best his 10-time National Champion status. With so many combinations of cars, tracks, and experiences, your path to victory will be unique! And, don’t forget to check out the all new challenge mode where you can test your skills against Donny himself! Are you Outlaw Tough? It’s the Greatest Show on Dirt!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iRacing presents the Official Game of The World of Outlaws, featuring the World of Outlaws Sprint Car, Late Models and Super DIRTcar Big Block Modifieds,  as well as 8 additional series including the all-new Micro Sprints, and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World of Outlaws: Dirt Racing 24 Gold Edition features 51 tracks, including all your favorites like Eldora Speedway, Knoxville Raceway, and Volusia Speedway Park, with new additions like Kevin Harvick’s Kern Raceway, Millbridge Speedway, Oswego Speedway and Huset's Speedway (coming soon). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a LEGEND like Donny Schatz as you work your way through Career Mode in your quest to best his 10-time National Champion status. With so many combinations of cars, tracks, and experiences, your path to victory will be unique! And, don’t forget to check out the all new challenge mode where you can test your skills against Donny himself! Are you Outlaw Tough? It’s the Greatest Show on Dirt!</p>", "short_description": "iRacing presents the Official Game of The World of Outlaws, featuring the World of Outlaws Sprint Car, Late Models and Super DIRTcar Big Block Modifieds, as well as 8 additional series including the all-new Micro Sprints, and many others.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281130/header.jpg?t=1738774663", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281130/331fbd8e5c744c8c8a55864ef0b1d28fbb27349e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738774663", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281130/331fbd8e5c744c8c8a55864ef0b1d28fbb27349e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738774663", "website": "https://worldofoutlawsgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit, Windows 11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core CPU or better – Some examples (but not limited to): AMD FX-6300, Intel Core i5-4430, Intel Core i5-2320, AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A gaming graphics card with at least 4GB of DEDICATED memory – Some examples (but not limited to): Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon 570 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li>